		"description": "Complete Postman collection for testing the Employee Leave Management System. Features JWT Authentication, RBAC, CRUD operations, Leave Application, Manager Approvals, and Dashboard Statistics.\n\n### How to Authenticate:\n1. Execute the `POST /api/auth/login` request in the Authentication folder with Admin, Manager, or Employee credentials.\n2. Copy the `token` from `data.token` in the response.\n3. In Postman, go to your request's **Authorization** tab, select type **Bearer Token**, and paste your token, or set the collection variable `jwt_token`.",
